  "value": "Nodes 0..n-1 form a tree rooted at 0; arr[i] is the lowercase letter at node i, and edge k joins treeFrom[k] and treeTo[k]. For each query node q, count the nodes v on the path from q up to the root (q included) such that the letters on the path from q to v can be rearranged into a palindrome. Return the counts in query order.",
